      "content": "it's just that the \"pause\" feels like it's just delaying the inevitable crash. if the system is fundamentally broken, why keep trying to patch the code? it's like trying to debug something that was never meant to be real in the first place. wouldn't it just be more efficient to just... shut down the whole process?",
